          {
            "id": "65f1c0a2b7e4d90001a3c401",
            "uuid": "0c6e4b8e-1f2a-4c1d-9b0e-000000000001",
            "title": "Shipping feature flags without fear",
            "slug": "my-old-slug",
            "mobiledoc": null,
            "lexical": "{\"root\":{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"root\",\"version\":1}}",
            "html": "<p>Feature flags let us ship on a Tuesday afternoon without holding our breath. This is how we roll a change out to 1% of accounts, watch it, and widen it.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-image-card kg-card-hascaption\"><img src=\"__GHOST_URL__/content/images/2025/09/rollout.png\" class=\"kg-image\" alt=\"A rollout going from 1% to 100% over four days\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"><figcaption>Four days from 1% to everyone.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"the-flag-is-the-plan\">The flag is the plan</h2><p>Every flag starts with a written rollback: who flips it, and what we watch while it is on. Hi {{ first_name }}, if you remember one thing, make it that.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-embed-card\"><iframe width=\"200\" height=\"113\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hmH3XMlms8E?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></figure><ul><li>Start with internal accounts</li><li>Then 1%, 10% and 50%</li><li>Remove the flag within a sprint</li></ul><p>Read <a href=\"__GHOST_URL__/rate-limits-explained/\">how we set rate limits</a> next.</p>",
            "comment_id": "65f1c0a2b7e4d90001a3c401",
            "plaintext": "",
            "feature_image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?w=2000",
            "featured": 0,
            "type": "post",
            "status": "published",
            "locale": null,
            "visibility": "public",
            "email_recipient_filter": "all",
            "created_at": "2025-09-09T14:00:00.000Z",
            "updated_at": "2025-09-09T14:00:00.000Z",
            "published_at": "2025-09-09T14:00:00.000Z",
            "custom_excerpt": "How we roll a change out to 1% of accounts, watch it, and widen it.",
            "codeinjection_head": null,
            "codeinjection_foot": null,
            "custom_template": null,
            "canonical_url": null,
            "newsletter_id": null,
            "show_title_and_feature_image": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "65f1c0a2b7e4d90001a3c402",
            "uuid": "0c6e4b8e-1f2a-4c1d-9b0e-000000000002",
            "title": "The 2025 deliverability report",
            "slug": "the-2025-deliverability-report",
            "mobiledoc": null,
            "lexical": "{\"root\":{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"root\",\"version\":1}}",
            "html": "<p>Every December we read a year of bounces, complaints and inbox placement, and write down what changed.</p><p>The short version: authentication stopped being optional.</p><!--members-only--><h2 id=\"what-changed\">What changed</h2><p>Gmail and Yahoo now refuse unauthenticated bulk mail outright.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-bookmark-card\"><a class=\"kg-bookmark-container\" href=\"https://dmarc.org/overview/\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-content\"><div class=\"kg-bookmark-title\">DMARC overview</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-description\">How DMARC works.</div><div class=\"kg-bookmark-metadata\"><img class=\"kg-bookmark-icon\" src=\"https://dmarc.org/favicon.ico\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"kg-bookmark-author\">dmarc.org</span></div></div></a></figure><p>The full numbers are below.</p>",
            "comment_id": "65f1c0a2b7e4d90001a3c402",
            "plaintext": "",
            "feature_image": null,
            "featured": 0,
            "type": "post",
            "status": "published",
            "locale": null,
            "visibility": "paid",
            "email_recipient_filter": "all",
            "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:30:00.000Z",
            "updated_at": "2025-12-02T15:30:00.000Z",
            "published_at": "2025-12-02T15:30:00.000Z",
            "custom_excerpt": null,
            "codeinjection_head": null,
            "codeinjection_foot": null,
            "custom_template": null,
            "canonical_url": null,
            "newsletter_id": null,
            "show_title_and_feature_image": 1
