            "newsletter_id": null,
            "show_title_and_feature_image": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "65f1c0a2b7e4d90001a3c404",
            "uuid": "0c6e4b8e-1f2a-4c1d-9b0e-000000000004",
            "title": "Ask Acme #12: warming up a new domain",
            "slug": "ask-acme-12-warming-up-a-new-domain",
            "mobiledoc": null,
            "lexical": "{\"root\":{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"root\",\"version\":1}}",
            "html": "<p>You asked how long a new sending domain needs before it can carry a full send.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-image-card\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526378722484-bd91ca387e72?w=1200\" class=\"kg-image\" alt loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\"></figure><p>Our answer: four weeks, starting with your most engaged readers.</p>",
